Value Required prefix ([0-9a-fA-F:.]+/\d+)
Value nexthop ([0-9a-fA-F:.]+)
Value origin (\S+)
Value local_pref (\d+)
Value med (\d+)
Value as_path (\d+(?:[,\s]+\d+)*)
Value communities (\d+:\d+(?:,\d+:\d+)*)
Value large_communities (\d+:\d+:\d+(?:,\d+:\d+:\d+)*)
Value best (A)
Value description (\S+)

Start
  ^\s+peer=${description}\s+dst=${prefix} -> Continue
  ^.*nexthop=${nexthop} -> Continue
  ^.*origin=${origin}\s+as-path=sequence\s+${as_path}.*$$ -> Record